1309+ 7AC1              .store_cell:
1310+ 7AC1 12               ld   (de), a
1311+ 7AC2 13               inc  de
1312+ 7AC3 0B               dec  bc
1313+ 7AC4 78               ld   a, b
1314+ 7AC5 B1               or   c
1315+ 7AC6 20 B2            jr   nz, .byte_loop
1316+ 7AC8
1317+ 7AC8 DD E1            pop  ix
1318+ 7ACA C1               pop  bc
1319+ 7ACB D1               pop  de
1320+ 7ACC E1               pop  hl
1321+ 7ACD C9               ret
