 414+ 87A7              ; CheckWillyItemCollision
 415+ 87A7              ;
 416+ 87A7              ; Verifica collisione bounding box (16x16 vs 8x8) tra Willy e un item.
 417+ 87A7              ; Input:
 418+ 87A7              ;   A = Item Col (0..31)
 419+ 87A7              ;   H = Item Row (0..15)
 420+ 87A7              ; Output:
